    RPM » Automatically create new repositories (#6300)
    
    > This patch is the first step in moving the rpm build infrastructure to
    the main repository. I've been talking about this for a while (maybe
    it's now years?) and it's finally time.
    >
    > You may still remember that we talked abouzt me just porting things
    over. That means, these pull requests usually don't need a review and
    I'll just meger it. That being said, if someone is actually interested,
    I'm happy if you take a look at these (and maybe even help working on
    these).
    
    This patch automatically creates new repositories whenever `develop`
    switches to a new version. This ensures that a repository for each
    version always exists. Even if it is still empty.
    
